2026-10-13T10:10:57.8059626Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8059950Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8060492Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
