2026-10-13T10:10:57.8061714Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8062029Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8062525Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8062967Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8063358Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8063778Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8064233Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8064689Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8065139Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8065595Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8066029Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8066612Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8067017Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8067436Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8067950Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8068426Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8068858Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8069415Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8069845Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8070142Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8070491Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
