2026-10-13T10:10:57.8071245Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8071562Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T10:10:57.8071944Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
